N5008 [over.match.funcs]/2: the implicit object argument pairs with the
implicit object parameter; the deduction-time convertibility pre-filter
must skip both together.  Distilled from allocator_traits::construct's
`__a.construct(__p, ...)` member call (std::map node construction), which
was rejected as not-convertible by the off-by-one object/parameter pairing.
g++/clang++ runtime-verified.
